@startuml
' Source: ../apollo-timer-architecture.drawio (page 03b-timer-expiry)
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans CJK KR
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor white
  ParticipantBorderColor #235D86
  ParticipantFontColor #172C43
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ArrowColor #235D86
  ArrowFontColor #172C43
  MessageAlign center
  ParticipantPadding 10
}
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor #94A3B8
scale max 790 width

participant "Guest driver" as p0
participant "Timer model" as p1
participant "Event scheduler" as p2
participant "Interrupt controller" as p3

note over p0, p3
QEMU: CPU-local / AP MMIO (RSE는 별도 SSE 모델)
end note
p0 -> p1 : 1. CVAL/TVAL · CTL 설정
p1 -> p2 : 2. QEMU virtual time 기준 expiry 예약
p2 -> p1 : 3. QEMUTimer callback
p1 -> p3 : 4. compare / ENABLE / IMASK → IRQ level
p3 -> p0 : 5. CPU exception → ISR
p0 -> p1 : 6. mask / disable / next deadline → 재계산
note over p0, p3
SystemC: CL0 host_gtimer / MMIO CVAL
end note
p0 -> p1 : 7. CVAL · CTL 쓰기 → rearm event
p1 -> p2 : 8. SystemC count 기준 wait(delay, events)
p2 -> p1 : 9. deadline 또는 Counter / register 변경
p1 -> p3 : 10. 조건 재평가 → signal socket IRQ level
p3 -> p0 : 11. GIC → CL0 FIQ → timer_isr
p0 -> p1 : 12. mask / next CVAL → 재계산

@enduml
